{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a divine journey in <strong>It's Hard To Be A Support</strong>, a thrilling 2D action game where you play as an angelic protector. Guide a team of four valiant warriors through treacherous lands, wielding sacred powers to heal, empower, and cleanse them of dark afflictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master dynamic combat, weave through enemy hordes, and face epic bosses. Your divine abilities shape the fate of your warriors. Will you lead them to victory or fall to the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995820/extras/b67ee1cd4ec1b3dcb94d2ae4520df865.poster.avif?t=1764953858\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995820/extras/b67ee1cd4ec1b3dcb94d2ae4520df865.webm?t=1764953858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995820/extras/b67ee1cd4ec1b3dcb94d2ae4520df865.mp4?t=1764953858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty level</strong>: three settings so that everyone can adapt the game to their skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Powers</strong>: Heal wounds, boost warrior strength, and dispel curses with angelic abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foes</strong>: Battle diverse enemies and colossal bosses in vibrant, hand-crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Balance healing, buffs, and cleansing to keep your team alive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995820/extras/6aaf41a3ebb320c31c6360911d58b